Third-party dependencies
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
All runtime dependencies are licensed under MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, ISC, Zlib or
compatible permissive licenses. tools/check-licenses.mjs verifies this for the
Rust workspace (cargo metadata) and the npm workspace (package.json "license"),
and CI runs it on every change. The authoritative per-dependency list is
produced by that script (see docs/licenses.md).

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Benchmark data
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Benchmark datasets are NOT redistributed. bench/scenarios/*/fetch.py downloads
them from their original sources with pinned URLs and SHA-256 checksums; each
scenario's LICENSE.md states the dataset license and required attribution.
